notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T10:38:29.492Z",claude-orchestrator,The closeout workflow closes this item after the PR merges.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T10:38:29.492Z",claude-orchestrator,"Schedule-event payloads carry no repository object, so a reusable workflow must resolve the caller's default branch through the API."
